It is a shortcut of the property path : crm:E21 Person → (inverse of) crm:P98 brought into life→ crm:E67 Birth → crm:P4 has time-span → crm:E52 Time-Span → crm:P81 ongoing throughout → crm:E61 Time Primitive but it imposes some specific rules regarding the possible values of the time primitive as defined by the target class sdh-short:C1 Standard Date-Time.
It is an equivalent with the DBpedia dbo:birthDate and Wikidata wdt:P569 Date of Birth properties.</rdfs:comment>
                <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has birth date</rdfs:label>
                <skos:notation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sdh-short:P2</skos:notation>
                <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="https://ontome.net/ontology/p3087"/>
                <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person"/>
                </owl:ObjectProperty>   <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://sdhss.org/ontology/shortcuts/P11">
                <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E62"/>
                <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property associates any instance of crm:E1 CRM Entity with a literal string expressing a concise textual definition of the entity. The definition is intended to provide a short, explanatory description that supports understanding and identification of the entity by human users.
This property enables the documentation of lightweight definitions without requiring explicit modelling of the definition as an instance of crm:E33 Linguistic Object. It is therefore intended primarily for documentation, display, and contextual clarification, rather than for detailed linguistic or discourse analysis.
Semantically, this property is a shortcut for the following path: crm:E1 CRM Entity → crm:P129i is subject of → crm:E33 Linguistic Object → crm:P190 has symbolic content → crm:E62 String
The value should be brief and descriptive rather than analytical or argumentative and should not be used for extensive scholarly commentary, interpretation, or argumentation; such content should be modelled explicitly using crm:E33 Linguistic Object where required.
This property has no formal impact on classification or reasoning and must ot be used as a substitute for scholarly definitions.</rdfs:comment>
                <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has definition</rdfs:label>
                <skos:notation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sdh-short:P11</skos:notation>
                <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="https://ontome.net/ontology/p3203"/>
                <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person"/>
                </owl:ObjectProperty>   <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://sdhss.org/ontology/shortcuts/P9">
                <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E62"/>
                <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property assigns to any instance of crm:E1 CRM Entity a literal string representing the preferred human-readable label. This property''s value is intended to be the default label used for identification and display purposes in user interfaces, search results, and listings.
This property is equivalent to skos:prefLabel.
Semantically, it is a shortcut for the following path: crm:E1 CRM Entity → ^sdh:P11 has appellation for language → sdh:C11 Appellation in a Language → sdh:P13 refers to name → crm:E41 Appellation → crm:P190 has symbolic content → crm:E62 String, As a shortcut property, it simplifies access to the preferred appellation value without providing the full SDHSS naming pattern.
This property does not replace the explicit modelling of appellations using sdh:C11 Appellation in a Language and crm:E41 Appellation, but provides a simplified access point for applications. It is intended purely for identification and presentation, not for analytical or classificatory reasoning. Full appellation modelling should be retained for detailed linguistic, historical, or contextual analysis.</rdfs:comment>
                <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has standard label</rdfs:label>
                <skos:notation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sdh-short:P9</skos:notation>
                <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="https://ontome.net/ontology/p3201"/>
                <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person"/>
                </owl:ObjectProperty>   <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://sdhss.org/ontology/shortcuts/P11">
